	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hide_ship_hint1_start"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どうした？　しんにゅうしゃ！▼
オレに　かてたら
パスワードの　ヒントを　くれてやる▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T07:23:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:01:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どうした？　侵入者！▼
オレに　勝てたら
パスワードの　ヒントを　くれてやる▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T07:24:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:01:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ヒント1-0</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:01:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:01:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hide_ship_hint1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>パスワードの　ヒントは……▼
イッシュちほうの
でんせつポケモンの　なまえだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T07:30:00" />
