				Time="2011-08-01T10:02:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>船の　中って　退屈なんだ
ちょいと　遊んでやるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:37:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
