	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hide_ship_hint3_start"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>われら　プラズマだんは
イッシュちほうを　しはいする！▼
そのためだ！
おまえの　ポケモンを　よこせ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:11:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:02:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>我ら　プラズマ団は
イッシュ地方を　支配する！▼
そのためだ！
おまえの　ポケモンを　よこせ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:28:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:02:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ヒント3-0</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:02:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ３</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:02:27" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hide_ship_hint3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけたからには
いさぎよく　おしえてやる▼
パスワードの　さいしょの　もじは
レ　だ！▼
ケチくさい　とか　いうなよ
そういうのは　おもうだけにしろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:20:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T10:47:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>負けたからには
潔く　教えてやる▼
パスワードの　最初の　文字は
レ　だ！▼
ケチくさい　とか　いうなよ
そういうのは　思うだけにしろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:21:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T10:47:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ヒント3-1
・レシラムのヒント</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:20:31" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ３</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T12:28:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hide_ship_hint3_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まけたからには
いさぎよく　おしえてやる▼
パスワードの　さいしょの　もじは
ゼ　だ！▼
ケチくさい　とか　いうなよ
そういうのは　おもうだけにしろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T08:20:13" />
