	<TextRow
		Label="msg_hide_ship_hint5_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フフフ……　パスワードを
さがして　たたかう　トレーナーよ▼
しょうぶに　かっても　こたえを
おしえてもらえるとは　かぎらないぜ▼
なにか　くれるかも　しれないけどな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T10:28:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T10:48:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フフフ……　パスワードを
探して　戦う　トレーナーよ▼
勝負に　勝っても　ヒントを
教えてもらえるとは　かぎらないぜ▼
なにか　くれるかも　しれないけどな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T10:28:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T10:48:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ヒント5-1</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T10:43:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ５</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-25T12:28:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
